cekirdek.com/itu-cekirdek-haberleri-temmuz-2026-1/...</p><div class="q_masonry_blog_post_info"></div></div></article></div><a  itemprop="url" href="https://blog.itucekirdek.com" target="_blank" data-hover-background-color='#f49b35' data-hover-border-color='#f49b35' data-hover-color='#ffffff' class="qbutton  medium center default" style="color: #ffffff; border-color: #f6921e; margin: 2em 0em; background-color: #f6921e;">Tüm Yazılar</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="anasayfahaberleren"  data-q_id="#anasayfablog"    class="vc_row wpb_row section vc_row-fluid  anasayfablog anasayfahaberler vc_custom_1721388280879 grid_section" style=' text-align:center;'><div class=" section_inner clearfix"><div class='section_inner_margin clearfix'><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
